# Environment variables

Copy to Netlify site environment or `.env` for local `netlify dev`.

```bash
# Database (Netlify Database)
NETLIFY_DATABASE_URL=
DATABASE_URL=

# Stripe
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=
STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=

# Twilio (SMS front desk)
TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID=
TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN=
TWILIO_FROM_NUMBER=

# Google Calendar (optional — mock mode without)
GOOGLE_CALENDAR_ACCESS_TOKEN=

# AI replies (Netlify AI Gateway or OpenAI)
AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY=
AI_GATEWAY_URL=

# Site URL (production)
URL=https://your-site.netlify.app
```

## Twilio webhook

Point inbound SMS webhook to:
```
https://your-site.netlify.app/.netlify/functions/sms-webhook
```

## Scheduled functions

Configured in function config:
- `seo-generate` — weekly
- `content-generate` — monthly
- `coach-report` — monthly

Trigger manually during development:
```bash
netlify functions:invoke seo-generate
```
